### Treatment Plan Type & Treatment Protocol 
::: {.panel-tabset}


## Sunburst Chart
The following  sunburst chart is used to visualize the hierarchical relationship between treatment plan types and treatment protocols, with segment sizes representing the number of unique patients. The table below provides a detailed breakdown of patient counts and episode totals for each Treatment Plan Type and treatment protocol combination.

::: {.callout-tip}
This visualization is limited to the top 10 treatment protocols per plan type with more than 500 unique patients due to the high number of categories. Patients may appear under multiple protocols, so protocol-level counts are not mutually exclusive. Percentages shown on hover (% of shown) are relative to the total across displayed categories only, not the full dataset.
